flowchart LR
    T1[Text Chunk A] --> EMB[Embedding Model]
    T2[Text Chunk B] --> EMB
    Q[User Query] --> EMB
    EMB -- vector A --> VDB[(Vector Index)]
    EMB -- vector B --> VDB
    EMB -- query vector --> SIM[Similarity Search - cosine / dot-product]
    VDB --> SIM
    SIM --> TOPK[Top-K Nearest Chunks]
